  "description": "When the world fractures and chaos consumes all certainty, Chaos Vanguard remains. Born from conflict and tested by ruin, we do not flee disorder — we endure it. While others fall to confusion, we impose discipline, purpose, and resolve.\nWe are not agents of chaos. We are the order that survives it. Forged in turmoil and strengthened by collapse, we stand as the final structure when everything else is reduced to ash. When chaos destroys the world as it was, Chaos Vanguard prevails — steady, united, and unbroken",
